{"title":"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">2006 AMC 12A #11</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">2008 AMC 10A #11</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following describes the graph of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/3/9d3c5de1665d772d27931cb0db25f2c0fa8839a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)^2=x^2+y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/3/3532ca04dcd0c040f8d63c76e6195e785bf2cfd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\text{the empty set}\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\text{one point}\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\text{two lines}\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\text{a circle}\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\text{the entire plane}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"694\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/3/9937145e4db273bc0ce1869b57d1fa4dbbe49ef0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}(x+y)^2&amp;=x^2+y^2\\\\ x^2 + 2xy + y^2 &amp;= x^2 + y^2\\\\ 2xy &amp;= 0\\end{align*}\" width=\"188\" height=\"71\" />\nEither <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />. The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Union\" title=\"Union\">union</a> of them is 2 lines, and thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/8/2484f88154fadcf9c781bba19becdae88696b77f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/b/77bc9852606b67fe448031002c3e27a4b8a97bd1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,-50)--(0,50));draw((-50,0)--(50,0));[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A\">2006 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"5